      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        82.18360900878906,
        142.85940551757812,
        99.03961181640625
      ],
      "text": "5.4\t TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        143.07530212402344,
        86.19041442871094,
        250.37831115722656,
        97.98960876464844
      ],
      "text": "infection control",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 9.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        106.732421875,
        513.5064086914062,
        120.08392333984375
      ],
      "text": "The community has a right to safe health care and to attendance at a clinic or hospital",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        122.72894287109375,
        513.368408203125,
        136.0804443359375
      ],
      "text": "without fear of contracting TB, and health workers have a right to a safe working",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        138.7254638671875,
        513.4489135742188,
        152.07696533203125
      ],
      "text": "environment. The association of TB with HIV and the emergence of MDR-TB and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        154.72198486328125,
        513.4490356445312,
        168.073486328125
      ],
      "text": "extensively drug-resistant TB (XDR-TB) make TB infection control increasingly important.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        179.22845458984375,
        513.4374389648438,
        192.5799560546875
      ],
      "text": "Infection control measures should be delivered as part of a patient-centred approach.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        195.2249755859375,
        513.403076171875,
        208.57647705078125
      ],
      "text": "Awareness-raising activities in the community garner social support for reducing TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        211.22149658203125,
        513.4491577148438,
        224.572998046875
      ],
      "text": "transmission in the community; they also help to increase sustainable behaviour and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        227.218017578125,
        513.3916015625,
        240.56951904296875
      ],
      "text": "social change, and to minimize the stigma inherently associated with identifying",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        243.21453857421875,
        513.3914794921875,
        256.5660400390625
      ],
      "text": "potentially infectious individuals and placing them in safe, separate environments.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        259.2110595703125,
        513.3914794921875,
        272.56256103515625
      ],
      "text": "Communities have an important role in, and responsibility for, preventing TB transmission",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        275.20758056640625,
        280.4013671875,
        288.55908203125
      ],
      "text": "in congregate settings and households.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        299.71405029296875,
        513.4835205078125,
        313.0655517578125
      ],
      "text": "All these measures create a supportive environment for detection of new cases and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        315.7105712890625,
        513.403076171875,
        329.06207275390625
      ],
      "text": "provision of care. Sustained political, institutional and financial commitment are needed,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        331.7070617675781,
        513.3683471679688,
        345.0585632324219
      ],
      "text": "as is the involvement of all disciplines that can promote implementation of adequate TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        347.70355224609375,
        513.4720458984375,
        361.0550537109375
      ],
      "text": "infection control measures in the context of general infection prevention and control",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        363.7000427246094,
        150.0028839111328,
        377.0515441894531
      ],
      "text": "programmes.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        389.90472412109375,
        261.0673828125,
        406.6327209472656
      ],
      "text": "TB infection control guidelines",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        410.47882080078125,
        513.4721069335938,
        423.830322265625
      ],
      "text": "WHO has published infection control guidelines for prevention of TB transmission",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        426.40631103515625,
        513.380126953125,
        439.8268127441406
      ],
      "text": "(24, 25) in a variety of settings  . These guidelines cover both reduction of the risk",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        442.4718017578125,
        513.4605102539062,
        455.82330322265625
      ],
      "text": "of TB transmission in health care facilities, congregate settings and households and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        458.4682922363281,
        513.4376220703125,
        471.8197937011719
      ],
      "text": "prioritization of TB infection control measures at the national level, depending on the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        474.46478271484375,
        240.78390502929688,
        487.8162841796875
      ],
      "text": "burden of TB, HIV and MDR-TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        496.1307678222656,
        513.4260864257812,
        509.4822692871094
      ],
      "text": "Table 5 lists actions for effective TB infection control as developed by the TB Infection",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        512.1272583007812,
        513.4605102539062,
        525.478759765625
      ],
      "text": "Control Subgroup of the TB/HIV Working Group in collaboration with WHO.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        528.1237182617188,
        513.3914184570312,
        541.4752197265625
      ],
      "text": "Unfortunately, active prevention control measures may result in greater stigma, and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        544.1202392578125,
        513.4718627929688,
        557.4717407226562
      ],
      "text": "simultaneous implementation of community advocacy campaigns may therefore be",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        560.1167602539062,
        315.4879150390625,
        573.46826171875
      ],
      "text": "important to reduce stigma and discrimination.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.21728515625,
        582.3126220703125,
        510.2332763671875,
        596.5325927734375
      ],
      "text": "Actions for effective TB infection control: safety without stigma  (24)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03729248046875,
        582.6005859375,
        124.21728515625,
        596.5325927734375
      ],
      "text": "Table 5.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.9717025756836,
        605.8984985351562,
        362.3817138671875,
        620.8984985351562
      ],
      "text": "Include patients and community in advocacy campaigns",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        610.723876953125,
        110.96989440917969,
        618.723876953125
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.9717025756836,
        623.8984985351562,
        402.0617370605469,
        638.8984985351562
      ],
      "text": "Develop, implement, and regularly review an infection control plan",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        628.723876953125,
        110.96989440917969,
        636.723876953125
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.9717025756836,
        641.8984985351562,
        249.95172119140625,
        656.8984985351562
      ],
      "text": "Ensure safe sputum collection",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        646.723876953125,
        110.96989440917969,
        654.723876953125
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.9717025756836,
        659.8984985351562,
        312.78173828125,
        674.8984985351562
      ],
      "text": "Promote cough etiquette and cough hygiene",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        664.723876953125,
        110.96989440917969,
        672.723876953125
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.9717025756836,
        677.8984985351562,
        393.8917541503906,
        692.8984985351562
      ],
      "text": "Triage people with presumptive TB for “fast-track” or separation",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        682.723876953125,
        110.96989440917969,
        690.723876953125
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.9717025756836,
        695.8984985351562,
        330.15167236328125,
        710.8984985351562
      ],
      "text": "Ensure rapid diagnosis and initiation of treatment",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        700.723876953125,
        110.96989440917969,
        708.723876953125
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.9717025756836,
        713.8984985351562,
        226.44174194335938,
        728.8984985351562
      ],
      "text": "Improve room ventilation",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        718.723876953125,
        110.96989440917969,
        726.723876953125
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.9717025756836,
        731.8984985351562,
        239.25172424316406,
        746.8984985351562
      ],
      "text": "Protect health care workers",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        736.723876953125,
        110.96989440917969,
        744.723876953125
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.9717025756836,
        749.8984985351562,
        194.94174194335938,
        764.8984985351562
      ],
      "text": "Capacity building",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        754.723876953125,
        110.96989440917969,
        762.723876953125
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.9717025756836,
        767.8984985351562,
        266.82171630859375,
        782.8984985351562
      ],
      "text": "Monitor infection control practices",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        772.723876953125,
        110.96989440917969,
        780.723876953125
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "50",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
